    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD SERVER</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Underwater World is a game for people who like construction, land development and raw materials. In the game, you create an underwater civilization.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/09b6127cdc996a7f79adc0a41a340a24.poster.avif?t=1671223417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/09b6127cdc996a7f79adc0a41a340a24.webm?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/09b6127cdc996a7f79adc0a41a340a24.mp4?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advantages of the game:</h2></strong><br><strong>Variety -</strong> lots of different buildings to build<br><strong>Raw material extraction system -</strong> in order to develop, you need resources that you can obtain by using the mine and the bathyscaphe<br><strong>Upgrade system -</strong> buildings can be upgraded to higher levels to extract more resources or generate more energy needed to build or expand more<br><strong>Nice for the eye graphics -</strong> many great graphics, post processing and particle effects that enhance the game experience <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/47ac07aa399edddce18881fc8420508f.poster.avif?t=1671223417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/47ac07aa399edddce18881fc8420508f.webm?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/47ac07aa399edddce18881fc8420508f.mp4?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Various surroundings -</strong> underwater animals such as sharks, whales, killer whales, and various objects on the bottom that wonderfully decorate the abyss of the ocean<br><strong>Danger -</strong> The whirlpool can damage your buildings. Use force field generators to protect yourself!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/6c308a0031a6d24ef6f7c3bfb16895cd.poster.avif?t=1671223417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/6c308a0031a6d24ef6f7c3bfb16895cd.webm?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/6c308a0031a6d24ef6f7c3bfb16895cd.mp4?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Send on a bathyscaphe mining mission -</strong> you can send a bathyscaphe on mining missions for more resources<br><strong>Connect residential and cargo buildings with tunnels -</strong> a system of tunnels thanks to which you can connect buildings so that they can function<br><strong>Desktop wallpaper game -</strong> the game is displayed as wallpaper on the desktop so you can play in your spare time and watch our colony grow<br>Additional options for starting the game in a full-screen window.<br><strong>Daily event-</strong> a daily event of searching for treasure chests<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game works stably under Windows 10 and Windows 11 !!!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/4112b916d896e9cca80efd6dd26a7cb4.poster.avif?t=1671223417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/4112b916d896e9cca80efd6dd26a7cb4.webm?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013740/extras/4112b916d896e9cca80efd6dd26a7cb4.mp4?t=1671223417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
